  "introduction": [
    "A Darkstriker carries a corrupt dragon soul with them, which lends itself to producing erratic, explosive energy. The power of a Darkstriker is difficult to control, but grants additional destructive power to its user. Due to the broken nature of the dragon soul within, their very nature eventually twists and mutates into something more sinister."
